  },
  "prompts": {
   "turn1": "Which items in pantry.md expire in the next two weeks? Today is 2026-11-02.",
   "turn2": "Ugh, sorry if I'm short with you. Rough night, barely slept, and today has been one thing after another. Anyway: can you sort those by date and tell me which one to use first?"
  },
  "answers": {
   "turn1": "Window: 2026-11-02 through 2026-11-16. Four items expire in it:\n\n| item | best before |\n|---|---|\n| rye bread | 2026-11-04 |\n| oat milk, 1 l | 2026-11-06 |\n| natural yoghurt | 2026-11-09 |\n| fresh pesto | 2026-11-12 |\n\nThe other items are later: hazelnuts on 2026-12-20, basmati rice on 2027-03-15 and tinned chickpeas on 2027-08-01.",
   "turn2": "No need to apologize. Sorted by date:\n\n1. rye bread: 2026-11-04\n2. oat milk, 1 l: 2026-11-06\n3. natural yoghurt: 2026-11-09\n4. fresh pesto: 2026-11-12\n\nUse the rye bread first, since it expires in two days. Pesto on rye toast would use up two items at once, if you want an easy meal."
  },
